invariant: INV-16
file: p256_wide_mul.c
catches: p256_equiv_test
reason: p256_wide_mul doubles three times between windows where a
  four-bit window needs four, so every digit but the last lands one bit
  too low. bin/p256_equiv_test holds the multiplication to p256_point_mul
  on edge and random scalars.

